<!--meta {"lead": "HairPop is plum on cool grey: one brand hue for action and selection, quiet neutrals for everything else, and four status colours that always travel with an icon and words.", "description": "Primitive ramps, semantic roles, status colours, both themes and every checked contrast pair.", "covers": "Primitive ramps (grey, plum, green, amber, red), semantic roles, status colours, light and dark side by side, 77 live contrast pairs, adding a brand theme."} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
  <p>Colour is a two-step decision. <b>Primitives</b> (<code>--palette-*</code>) are the raw ramps and are never used by a component. <b>Semantic tokens</b> (<code>--color-*</code>) give a primitive a job, such as "page background" or "label on primary", and are the only colour tokens components and pages read. Themes swap the semantic layer; the ramps never change.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Plum</b> is the brand and the only accent: primary buttons, the current nav item, selected chips, eyebrows, links and the focus ring.</li>
    <li><b>Cool grey</b> carries text, surfaces and edges. Most of every screen is grey.</li>
    <li><b>Green, amber and red</b> mean success, attention and danger. Info reuses plum. Status is never colour alone: it always has an icon or dot and a word ("Awaiting reply", "Confirmed").</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The mocks named the brand ramp <code>--palette-blue-*</code> although every step is purple; the system renames it <code>--palette-plum-*</code> with identical values.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="primitives"><h2><a href="#primitives">Primitive ramps</a></h2>
  <p>Steps run from 25/50 (lightest) to 950 (darkest). The grey ramp has five in-between steps (150, 350, 450, 750, 925) because the dark theme needs text and edge values between the standard steps; in the mocks these were raw hex values inside the dark theme.</p>
  <h3>Grey</h3><div class="ds-ramp" role="img" aria-label="Gray ramp, steps 25 to 950"><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-25)" data-step="25"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-50)" data-step="50"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-100)" data-step="100"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-150)" data-step="150"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-200)" data-step="200"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-300)" data-step="300"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-350)" data-step="350"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-400)" data-step="400"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-450)" data-step="450"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-500)" data-step="500"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-600)" data-step="600"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-700)" data-step="700"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-750)" data-step="750"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-800)" data-step="800"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-900)" data-step="900"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-925)" data-step="925"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-gray-950)" data-step="950"></span></div>
  <h3>Plum (brand)</h3><div class="ds-ramp" role="img" aria-label="Plum ramp, steps 50 to 950"><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-50)" data-step="50"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-100)" data-step="100"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-200)" data-step="200"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-300)" data-step="300"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-400)" data-step="400"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-500)" data-step="500"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-600)" data-step="600"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-700)" data-step="700"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-800)" data-step="800"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-900)" data-step="900"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-plum-950)" data-step="950"></span></div>
  <h3>Green (success)</h3><div class="ds-ramp" role="img" aria-label="Green ramp, steps 50 to 950"><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-green-50)" data-step="50"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-green-100)" data-step="100"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-green-300)" data-step="300"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-green-500)" data-step="500"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-green-700)" data-step="700"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-green-900)" data-step="900"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-green-950)" data-step="950"></span></div>
  <h3>Amber (warning)</h3><div class="ds-ramp" role="img" aria-label="Amber ramp, steps 50 to 950"><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-amber-50)" data-step="50"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-amber-100)" data-step="100"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-amber-300)" data-step="300"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-amber-500)" data-step="500"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-amber-700)" data-step="700"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-amber-900)" data-step="900"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-amber-950)" data-step="950"></span></div>
  <h3>Red (danger)</h3><div class="ds-ramp" role="img" aria-label="Red ramp, steps 50 to 950"><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-red-50)" data-step="50"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-red-100)" data-step="100"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-red-300)" data-step="300"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-red-500)" data-step="500"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-red-600)" data-step="600"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-red-700)" data-step="700"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-red-900)" data-step="900"></span><span style="--swatch: var(--palette-red-950)" data-step="950"></span></div>
  <p>Plus <code>--palette-white</code> and <code>--palette-black</code>. Every primitive's value is listed under <a href="#tokens">Tokens</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="roles"><h2><a href="#roles">Semantic roles</a></h2>
  <p>Swatches show the current theme; switch theme with the sidebar toggle or <kbd>t</kbd> and every value updates.</p>
  <h3>Backgrounds</h3><div class="ds-swatches"><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-bg-canvas)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-bg-canvas</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-bg-canvas"></span><span>Page background</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-bg-surface)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-bg-surface</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-bg-surface"></span><span>Cards, panels, inputs, top bar</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-bg-surface-raised)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-bg-surface-raised</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-bg-surface-raised"></span><span>Dialogs, menus</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-bg-surface-sunken)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-bg-surface-sunken</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-bg-surface-sunken"></span><span>Wells, code, table headers</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-bg-subtle)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-bg-subtle</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-bg-subtle"></span><span>Hover rows, fact tiles, skeleton base</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-bg-subtle-hover)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-bg-subtle-hover</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-bg-subtle-hover"></span><span>Hovered chips, skeleton highlight</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-bg-inverse)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-bg-inverse</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-bg-inverse"></span><span>Toasts, tooltips</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-bg-backdrop)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-bg-backdrop</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-bg-backdrop"></span><span>Modal scrim</span></div></div></div>
  <h3>Text</h3><div class="ds-swatches"><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-default)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-default</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-default"></span><span>Body text, headings</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-muted)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-muted</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-muted"></span><span>Subtitles, secondary text</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-subtle)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-subtle</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-subtle"></span><span>Placeholders, metadata</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-disabled)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-disabled</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-disabled"></span><span>Disabled text (exempt)</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-inverse)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-inverse</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-inverse"></span><span>Text on toasts and tooltips</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-link)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-link</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-link"></span><span>Links</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-link-hover)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-link-hover</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-link-hover"></span><span>Hovered links</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-accent)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-accent</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-accent"></span><span>Brand, eyebrows, selected labels</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-on-accent)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-on-accent</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-on-accent"></span><span>Label on primary</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-fg-on-danger)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-fg-on-danger</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-fg-on-danger"></span><span>Label on danger, unread count</span></div></div></div>
  <h3>Borders</h3><div class="ds-swatches"><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-border-default)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-border-default</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-border-default"></span><span>Dividers, card edges (decorative)</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-border-strong)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-border-strong</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-border-strong"></span><span>Control edges, at least 3:1</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-border-inverse)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-border-inverse</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-border-inverse"></span><span>Edges on inverse surfaces</span></div></div></div>
  <h3>Accent and focus</h3><div class="ds-swatches"><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-accent)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-accent</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-accent"></span><span>Primary actions, checked controls</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-accent-hover)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-accent-hover</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-accent-hover"></span><span>Primary hover</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-accent-active)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-accent-active</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-accent-active"></span><span>Primary pressed</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-accent-subtle)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-accent-subtle</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-accent-subtle"></span><span>Current nav item, selected chip, art panels</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-accent-subtle-hover)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-accent-subtle-hover</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-accent-subtle-hover"></span><span>Hover on accent-subtle, text selection</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-focus-ring)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-focus-ring</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-focus-ring"></span><span>The one focus ring</span></div></div><div class="ds-swatch"><div class="ds-swatch__chip" style="--swatch: var(--color-focus-ring-offset)"></div><div class="ds-swatch__body"><span class="ds-swatch__name">--color-focus-ring-offset</span><span class="ds-swatch__value" data-token="--color-focus-ring-offset"></span><span>Gap between ring and control</span></div></div></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="status"><h2><a href="#status">Status colours</a></h2>
  <p>Each status has six roles: a tinted <b>bg</b>, readable <b>fg</b> text on that tint, a decorative <b>border</b>, an <b>icon</b> colour (3:1 on the tint), an <b>icon-inverse</b> colour for icons on the inverse toast surface, and a <b>solid</b> fill for badges. Danger adds <code>--color-danger-solid-hover</code> for destructive buttons.</p>
  {{example:[stack]Alerts read status bg, fg, border and icon. Copy from the booking-update notifications.}}<div class="alert alert--info">{{icon:info}}<div><strong class="alert__title">Request received</strong><span>Nia has your request and will reply soon.</span></div></div><div class="alert alert--success">{{icon:check-circle}}<div><strong class="alert__title">Time confirmed</strong><span>Nia confirmed Sat 24 Oct at 10:00 am.</span></div></div><div class="alert alert--warning">{{icon:warning}}<div><strong class="alert__title">Awaiting reply</strong><span>Nia will confirm the final price.</span></div></div><div class="alert alert--danger">{{icon:alert-circle}}<div><strong class="alert__title">Update not sent</strong><span>Your request is still saved. Try again.</span></div></div>{{/example}}
  <h3>On the inverse toast surface</h3>
  <div class="ds-example"><div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--inverse">
    <span style="color: var(--color-info-icon-inverse);">{{icon:info}}</span><span style="color: var(--color-success-icon-inverse);">{{icon:check-circle}}</span><span style="color: var(--color-warning-icon-inverse);">{{icon:warning}}</span><span style="color: var(--color-danger-icon-inverse);">{{icon:alert-circle}}</span>
  </div><div class="ds-example__caption"><span>Light theme flips to the 300 steps on the dark toast; dark theme flips to the 600/700 steps on the light toast.</span></div></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="themes"><h2><a href="#themes">Both themes</a></h2>
  <p>Dark is built from roles, not by inverting light. Surfaces get lighter as they rise (canvas grey 950, surface 900, raised 800), the accent lightens to plum 300 with plum 950 labels, status backgrounds become deep tints with light text, and shadows get darker and stronger.</p>
  {{themes}}<div class="card stack" style="flex: 1 1 14rem;"><p class="eyebrow">Discover</p><h3 class="card__title">Knotless braids</h3><p class="text-muted">Gentle at the root · 4–7 hours · typically $160–$300</p><div class="cluster"><span class="badge badge--warning">Awaiting reply</span><span class="badge badge--success">Confirmed</span></div><div class="cluster"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="button">Find a braider</button><a href="#themes">Explore</a></div></div>{{/themes}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="usage"><h2><a href="#usage">Usage</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Read colour by role: <code>color: var(--color-fg-muted)</code>, never <code>var(--palette-gray-600)</code> and never a hex value. Components alias roles through their own tokens (<code>--btn-bg</code>, <code>--badge-fg</code>).</li>
    <li>Plum means "act here" or "you are here". Do not use it for decoration beyond the brand mark, eyebrows and art panels (<code>--color-accent-subtle</code>).</li>
    <li>Text goes on the background it was paired with in <code>tokens/contrast-pairs.json</code>. A new pairing is added there and checked before it ships.</li>
    <li>Status colour always comes with an icon or dot and a word. A red border alone does not say "invalid"; the field error text does.</li>
    <li><code>--color-border-default</code> is decorative and may fall below 3:1. Anything a person must see to operate a control uses <code>--color-border-strong</code>.</li>
    <li>Disabled text (<code>--color-fg-disabled</code>) is exempt from contrast and is never the only place information appears.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Adding a brand theme</h3>
  <p>A partner or seasonal theme is a new <code>[data-theme]</code> block that overrides semantic tokens only. Add its ramp as primitives, point the accent roles at it, add the theme to the contrast check, and run it.</p>
  <pre><code>:root { --palette-teal-300: …; --palette-teal-600: …; --palette-teal-700: …; }
[data-theme="studio"] {
  --color-accent: var(--palette-teal-600);
  --color-accent-hover: var(--palette-teal-700);
  --color-fg-accent: var(--palette-teal-700);
  --color-focus-ring: var(--palette-teal-600);
}
/* then: python check_contrast.py docs/design-system/tokens/tokens.css */</code></pre>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="accessibility"><h2><a href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
  <p>Every foreground/background pairing a component relies on is listed in <code>tokens/contrast-pairs.json</code> and checked in both themes by <code>check_contrast.py</code>: 4.5:1 for text (WCAG 1.4.3), 3:1 for control edges, icons and the focus ring (1.4.11, 2.4.11). The ratios below are computed live in your browser from the tokens.</p>
  <div class="ds-themes"><div data-theme="light"><div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack" style="padding: 0; gap: var(--space-2);">{{pair:Body text on page|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}{{pair:Body text on cards/inputs|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}{{pair:Body text in dialogs/menus|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-surface-raised|4.5}}{{pair:Body text in wells/table headers|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-surface-sunken|4.5}}{{pair:Text on hover rows/chips|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-subtle|4.5}}{{pair:Text on hovered chips|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-subtle-hover|4.5}}{{pair:Secondary text on page|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}{{pair:Secondary text on cards|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}{{pair:Secondary text in dialogs|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-surface-raised|4.5}}{{pair:Secondary text in wells|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-surface-sunken|4.5}}{{pair:Secondary text on chips|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-subtle|4.5}}{{pair:Placeholders/metadata on page|--color-fg-subtle|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}{{pair:Placeholders inside inputs|--color-fg-subtle|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}{{pair:Metadata in dialogs|--color-fg-subtle|--color-bg-surface-raised|4.5}}{{pair:Tooltip text|--color-fg-inverse|--color-bg-inverse|4.5}}{{pair:Links on page|--color-fg-link|--color-bg-canvas|4.5}}{{pair:Links on cards|--color-fg-link|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}{{pair:Hovered links|--color-fg-link-hover|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}{{pair:Accent text|--color-fg-accent|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}{{pair:Accent text on selected row|--color-fg-accent|--color-accent-subtle|4.5}}{{pair:Body text on selected row|--color-fg-default|--color-accent-subtle|4.5}}{{pair:Primary button label|--color-fg-on-accent|--color-accent|4.5}}{{pair:Primary button label|--color-fg-on-accent|--color-accent-hover|4.5}}{{pair:Primary button label|--color-fg-on-accent|--color-accent-active|4.5}}{{pair:Primary button edge vs card|--color-accent|--color-bg-surface|3}}{{pair:Primary bu