  <p>Two pairs differ by theme: solid badges use <code>--color-fg-inverse</code> labels in light and dark labels (<code>--color-fg-on-accent</code>, <code>--color-fg-on-danger</code>) in dark. Under <code>prefers-contrast: more</code> decorative borders become strong and muted text becomes default; under <code>forced-colors</code> the ring and borders hand over to system colours.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="tokens"><h2><a href="#tokens">Tokens</a></h2>
  <h3>Semantic: backgrounds, text, borders</h3><div class="ds-table-wrap"><table class="ds-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Token</th><th scope="col">Light</th><th scope="col">Dark</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{tok:Page background|--color-bg-canvas}}{{tok:Cards, panels, inputs, top bar|--color-bg-surface}}{{tok:Dialogs, menus|--color-bg-surface-raised}}{{tok:Wells, code, table headers|--color-bg-surface-sunken}}{{tok:Hover rows, fact tiles, skeleton base|--color-bg-subtle}}{{tok:Hovered chips, skeleton highlight|--color-bg-subtle-hover}}{{tok:Toasts, tooltips|--color-bg-inverse}}{{tok:Modal scrim|--color-bg-backdrop}}{{tok:Body text, headings|--color-fg-default}}{{tok:Subtitles, secondary text|--color-fg-muted}}{{tok:Placeholders, metadata|--color-fg-subtle}}{{tok:Disabled text (exempt)|--color-fg-disabled}}{{tok:Text on toasts and tooltips|--color-fg-inverse}}{{tok:Links|--color-fg-link}}{{tok:Hovered links|--color-fg-link-hover}}{{tok:Brand, eyebrows, selected labels|--color-fg-accent}}{{tok:Label on primary|--color-fg-on-accent}}{{tok:Label on danger, unread count|--color-fg-on-danger}}{{tok:Dividers, card edges (decorative)|--color-border-default}}{{tok:Control edges, at least 3:1|--color-border-strong}}{{tok:Edges on inverse surfaces|--color-border-inverse}}</tbody></table></div>
